notes: >-
  This is the code and aggregate-results release for the manuscript. The
  manuscript is in preparation; no journal citation or DOI exists. The MIT
  licence covers the code only. OAI and MRNet images, trained weights and
  row-level prediction/report/audit tables are not distributed. The workflow
  was not deployed, and no reader study or clinical-outcome endpoint was
  evaluated.
